IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `au-part8-more`

-- Tests for s 37. Expected values are written from the text: a reference to time means the legal time in the State or part of the
-- Commonwealth, unless the Act specifically states otherwise.

§ `Section 37`

-- The Act says nothing: the legal time in the State concerned.
#ASSERT `the time a reference to time in an Act means` NOTHING "Western Standard Time" EQUALS "Western Standard Time"
#ASSERT `the time a reference to time in an Act means` NOTHING "Eastern Standard Time" EQUALS "Eastern Standard Time"
-- The Act specifically states a time: that time, whatever the legal time of the place.
#ASSERT `the time a reference to time in an Act means` (JUST "Coordinated Universal Time") "Western Standard Time" EQUALS "Coordinated Universal Time"
